<title>USA: Kohl's June same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>Kohl's June same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kohl's Corp said Thursday same-store sales for the five weeks ended July 5 rose 14.1 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales gained 35 percent to $248.3 million in June, compared with $183.9 million a year ago.</p>
<p>For the year-to-date period, total sales increased 29.5 percent to $1.04 billion, compared with $804.1 million. Same- store year-to-date sales gained 9.8 percent.</p>
<p>As of July 5, company operated 170 stores compared with 136 stores at the same time last year.</p>
<p>At the end of the year, Kohl's will be operating 182 stores.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
